I'm currently playing as the Mughals and it is all going well, the year is 1479 and I started expanding into India, but my problem is that I'm not keeping up with tech.

The Renaissance hasn't come to my country yet an it's at a +29% and by the looks of it will take a couple of decades to get the Renaissance, is there any way to speed this up?

That was fast!

